            "content": "<p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); white-space-collapse: preserve;\">BV1v7411D7Dv</span><br></p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">这里给出一份名单，方便hym对照：</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">研究与记录：1.洞穴绘画</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">2.地基支柱</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">3.地脉</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">4.美国一夜宿命/美国一夜结果（简中翻译纰漏）</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">5.天才看门人/天才清洁工（同）</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">6.太古屋的历史</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">7.金字塔几何结构</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">8.电源内核</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">9.地基蚀刻画</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">案件卷宗：1.招财猫程序</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">2.流星山概要/流星山补充说明（主要内容为概要，区别于另一篇流星山补充说明）</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">3.流行山补充说明</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">4.基辅概要</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">5.基辅补充说明</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">6.电影摄影机补充说明</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">7.VHS录像带补充说明</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">通信：1.搬迁令</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">2.地基事故</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">3.不可接受行为备忘录</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">4.冒险已接受</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">5.一切皆类人</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">6.绿色</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">7.位移说明第1点</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">8.位移说明第2点</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">9.位移说明第3点</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">10.阿什：请求遭到拒绝</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">11.诺斯莫尔：最终警告</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">12.诺斯莫尔：医疗结果/检查结果（同）</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">13.计算机程序</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">14.新语言</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">多媒体：1.日志1：发现</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">2.日志2：地基</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">3.日志3：工作</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">4.日志4：通行证</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">5.日志5：金字塔</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">6.日志6：出发</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">7.日志7：变化</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">8.日志8：目的</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">9.FBC提醒：窗户</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">10.被拒绝的剧集</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">11.《美国一夜》系列集382</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">12.《美国一夜》系列集367</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">13.布莱恩的电影剧本3/布赖恩的电影巢穴3（同）</p><p data-v-4defef32=\"\" class=\"text\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 25px; word-break: break-all; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">缺什么hym对照着视频找就好。注意全收集必须要dlc通关后才能找齐。</p>"
